      "html": "<p>One failed part can fail the whole door. Check each part.</p><p><strong>Leaf.</strong> No holes or damage. The fire door label is there. Note any added letterbox or glass that harms it.</p><p><strong>Frame.</strong> No cracks or gaps to the wall.</p><p><strong>Gaps.</strong> 3mm or less at top and sides. 8mm or less at the bottom, or a seal fitted.</p><p><strong>Seals.</strong> Intumescent strips and smoke seals whole and not squashed.</p>"
